The current path is too long for the Save As dialog.=当前文件路径过长，无法打开“另存为”窗口。
Unable to open the Save As dialog (error code=无法打开“另存为”窗口（错误代码
Unknown error=未知错误
The protected folder requires administrator access, but EditMdViewSave.exe is missing. Reinstall the complete plugin package.=受保护目录需要管理员权限，但插件目录中缺少 EditMdViewSave.exe。请重新安装完整插件包。
The administrator request was cancelled. The file was not saved.=已取消管理员权限请求，文件没有保存。
Unable to start the elevated save helper:=无法启动管理员权限保存程序：
The elevated save helper did not return a process handle.=管理员权限保存程序未返回进程句柄。
An error occurred while waiting for the elevated save helper:=等待管理员权限保存程序时发生错误：
Elevated save failed:=管理员权限保存失败：
Preview generation failed in the background. Editing and saving remain available.=后台预览生成失败；编辑和保存仍可正常使用。
Live preview is paused for this large document. Editing and saving remain available.=文档较大，实时预览已暂停；编辑和保存仍可正常使用。
The file was modified by another program.\n\nUnsaved editor content was not overwritten. Resolve the external version before saving.=当前文件已被其他程序修改。\n\n编辑器中的未保存内容不会被覆盖；保存前请先处理外部版本。
